

<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="sv">

<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>ORBITAL - Raketstudio</title>

  <style>

    body {

      margin: 0;

      min-height: 100vh;

      background: #080d18;

      color: white;

      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

      display: grid;

      place-items: center;

      text-align: center;

    }

    main {

      padding: 30px;

    }

    h1 {

      color: #65c8ff;

      font-size: 42px;

      letter-spacing: 5px;

    }

    .rocket {

      font-size: 100px;

      margin: 30px;

    }

    p {

      color: #b8c7d9;

      font-size: 18px;

    }

  </style>

</head>

<body>

  <main>

    <h1>ORBITAL</h1>

    <div class="rocket">🚀</div>

    <h2>Välkommen till Raketstudio</h2>

    <p>Din resa mot rymden börjar här.</p>

  </main>

</body>

</html>
